Package: vabaxos-kokoro-model
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: Kokoro voice model for VabaxOS
 The neural network and the voices of Kokoro-82M v1.0 (ADR-0019), used by
 vabaxos-voice. They are in their own package, whose version is the one
 of the model, so an update of VabaxOS downloads them again only when the
 model changes (about 330 MB).
